      "side": 1,
      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Functionality (Short Writes \u0026 Error Cleanup):**\n\n1. **Short control transfers:** `libusb_control_transfer()` returns the number of bytes actually transferred. Checking only `if (ret \u003c 0)` allows a partial transfer (`0 \u003c\u003d ret \u003c static_cast\u003cint\u003e(chunk_size)`) to silently pass and advance `offset +\u003d chunk_size`, corrupting the flashed image. Check `if (ret !\u003d static_cast\u003cint\u003e(chunk_size))` (matching the short-read check in `dfu_poll_idle()`).\n2. **Leaked interface claim on early return:** The error returns at lines 539 and 548 leave `dfu_interface_` claimed, unlike the normal exit at lines 590–591. Please release the claimed interface and reset `dfu_interface_ \u003d -1` before returning `false`.\n\n```cpp\n\t\tret \u003d libusb_control_transfer(\n\t\t\tdev_handle_, kBmReqH2dClsIf, kDfuDownload, block_num,\n\t\t\tstatic_cast\u003cuint16_t\u003e(dfu_interface_),\n\t\t\tconst_cast\u003cuint8_t *\u003e(firmware.data() + offset),\n\t\t\tstatic_cast\u003cuint16_t\u003e(chunk_size), kUsbDfuTimeoutMs);\n\n\t\tif (ret !\u003d static_cast\u003cint\u003e(chunk_size)) {\n\t\t\tfprintf(stderr,\n\t\t\t\t\"\\nDFU_DOWNLOAD failed at block %u \"\n\t\t\t\t\"(offset 0x%zx): %s\\n\",\n\t\t\t\tblock_num, offset,\n\t\t\t\tret \u003c 0 ? libusb_error_name(ret) :\n\t\t\t\t\t  \"short write\");\n\n\t\t\t/* Try to clear error and abort. */\n\t\t\tdfu_clear_status();\n\t\t\tlibusb_release_interface(dev_handle_, dfu_interface_);\n\t\t\tdfu_interface_ \u003d -1;\n\t\t\treturn false;\n\t\t}\n\n\t\t/* Poll status to wait for block to be processed. */\n\t\tif (!dfu_poll_idle()) {\n\t\t\tfprintf(stderr,\n\t\t\t\t\"DFU status error after block %u \"\n\t\t\t\t\"(offset 0x%zx).\\n\",\n\t\t\t\tblock_num, offset);\n\t\t\tlibusb_release_interface(dev_handle_, dfu_interface_);\n\t\t\tdfu_interface_ \u003d -1;\n\t\t\treturn false;\n\t\t}\n```\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/18748e91-0dc2-4d16-beb6-33599aa4af20)",
